│                                                              ││A terminal UI for interacting with GitHub                                                     │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
│                                                              ││────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
│                                                              ││  🖼  PyPI - Version 🖼  PyPI - Downloads LazyGithub is a terminal UI client for interacting    │
│                                                              ││  with GitHub. It draws heavy inspiration from the lazygit project and uses Textual to        │
│                                                              ││  drive the terminal UI interactions. 🖼  Example screenshot                                   │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
│                                                              ││                                                                                              │
